Flight Expenses ETL
Project Overview

This project is a beginner ETL and data analysis project using flight itinerary data.

The goal is to practice extracting, transforming, and loading data using Python, Pandas, and SQLite, and then use SQL to analyze flight prices and routes.

Project Workflow
Raw CSV
   ↓
Extract
   ↓
Transform
   ↓
Cleaned CSV
   ↓
Load into SQLite
   ↓
SQL Analysis
